WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.200
For three years,

2
00:00:01.325 --> 00:00:03.600
Ethan Drake had carried the heaviest burdens of

3
00:00:03.613 --> 00:00:04.800
the Vanguard Guild.

4
00:00:05.563 --> 00:00:08.013
While the elite strike teams claimed the glory,

5
00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:09.413
the press conferences,

6
00:00:09.575 --> 00:00:11.413
and the multi-million credit bounties,

7
00:00:11.538 --> 00:00:13.425
Ethan walked three paces behind

8
00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:16.000
an unranked core porter whose mana channels had

9
00:00:16.013 --> 00:00:18.438
been deemed permanently fractured since birth.

10
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.513
He was the invisible mule of Sector Nine...

11
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.625
until tonight.

12
00:00:23.388 --> 00:00:25.888
Across the grand banquet hall of House Vance,

13
00:00:26.038 --> 00:00:28.850
beneath crystal chandeliers that mirrored the cold rain

14
00:00:28.863 --> 00:00:30.488
beating against the high windows,

15
00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:32.663
his loyalty was publicly auctioned.

16
00:00:33.425 --> 00:00:36.188
Lady Evelyn Cross did not lower her voice.

17
00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.638
She did not avert her gaze.

18
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.300
With a single,

19
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.613
dismissive flick of her manicured fingers,

20
00:00:42.763 --> 00:00:45.275
she cast their silver engagement band across the

21
00:00:45.288 --> 00:00:46.225
marble floor.

22
00:00:46.988 --> 00:00:48.813
The ring bounced against the stone,

23
00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:51.150
coming to a dead stop against Ethan's worn

24
00:00:51.163 --> 00:00:52.225
combat boots.

25
00:00:52.988 --> 00:00:55.625
Standing beside her was Captain Marcus Vance

26
00:00:55.825 --> 00:00:59.038
an A-Rank vanguard clad in bespoke titanium alloy,

27
00:00:59.263 --> 00:01:01.688
a predator who commanded the city’s most lucrative

28
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.938
dungeon licences.

29
00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.450
Evelyn stepped seamlessly into Marcus’s shadow,

30
00:01:06.613 --> 00:01:08.825
trading three years of shared survival for the

31
00:01:08.838 --> 00:01:10.638
security of a noble bloodline.

32
00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.438
Marcus did not draw his blade.

33
00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.538
In the upper circles of the Awakened nobility,

34
00:01:16.713 --> 00:01:19.750
physical violence was uncouth when social annihilation was

35
00:01:19.763 --> 00:01:20.800
so effortless.

36
00:01:21.563 --> 00:01:23.838
With a single gesture to the guild bailiffs,

37
00:01:23.925 --> 00:01:26.588
Marcus revoked Ethan’s porter licence on grounds of

38
00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:27.825
physical deficiency,

39
00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:29.950
stripping him of his guild stipend and his

40
00:01:29.963 --> 00:01:32.225
right to enter licensed gate facilities.

41
00:01:32.988 --> 00:01:35.238
Cast out into the neon-drenched alleys of the

42
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.163
Lower District, the cold rain soaked through Ethan’s

43
00:01:38.175 --> 00:01:39.263
frayed trench-coat

44
00:01:40.025 --> 00:01:42.363
Every step felt like wading through lead.

45
00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:45.200
His mana core throbbed with a dull,

46
00:01:45.313 --> 00:01:46.238
sickening ache

47
00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:49.413
the familiar burning sensation of a biological system

48
00:01:49.425 --> 00:01:50.463
running on empty.

49
00:01:51.225 --> 00:01:53.213
He was twenty-two penniless,

50
00:01:53.338 --> 00:01:55.050
and marked as dead weight by the most

51
00:01:55.063 --> 00:01:56.875
powerful syndicate in the capital.

52
00:01:57.748 --> 00:02:00.311
In a forgotten service corridor beneath the monorail

53
00:02:00.323 --> 00:02:02.698
tracks, Ethan’s knees finally buckled.

54
00:02:03.461 --> 00:02:05.173
His vital signs cratered.

55
00:02:05.936 --> 00:02:08.261
His vision tunnelled into pitch darkness as his

56
00:02:08.273 --> 00:02:10.586
heart rhythm stuttered to a near standstill.

57
00:02:11.348 --> 00:02:12.861
Two percent vitality.

58
00:02:13.623 --> 00:02:16.223
The threshold where mortal biology ceases.

59
00:02:16.986 --> 00:02:19.711
Yet, at the absolute edge of clinical death,

60
00:02:19.823 --> 00:02:21.773
the ambient air grew motionless.

61
00:02:22.536 --> 00:02:25.086
The sound of pouring rain halted in mid-air

62
00:02:25.848 --> 00:02:27.223
a crimson interface,

63
00:02:27.348 --> 00:02:29.386
forged from dark obsidian glass,

64
00:02:29.536 --> 00:02:31.923
crystallised directly before his retinas.

65
00:02:32.686 --> 00:02:34.836
Emergency Protocol Initialised:

66
00:02:34.961 --> 00:02:37.073
Host Biological Failure Imminent.

67
00:02:37.836 --> 00:02:40.336
Celestial Core Diagnostics Complete.

68
00:02:41.098 --> 00:02:42.723
Dormant Sovereign Protocol:

69
00:02:42.898 --> 00:02:43.898
Synchronised.

70
00:02:44.661 --> 00:02:47.273
Unlike the fragile blue interfaces issued by the

71
00:02:47.286 --> 00:02:48.798
International Hunter Ministry,

72
00:02:48.986 --> 00:02:50.998
this system bore no rank limits.

73
00:02:51.761 --> 00:02:53.248
No guild oversight.

74
00:02:54.011 --> 00:02:55.298
A cascade of warm,

75
00:02:55.423 --> 00:02:58.236
liquid fire surged outward from his fractured spine,

76
00:02:58.473 --> 00:03:00.686
burning away the necrotic tissue of his ruined

77
00:03:00.698 --> 00:03:01.423
channels.

78
00:03:02.186 --> 00:03:05.773
His notification log flashed a single baseline calibration:

79
00:03:05.973 --> 00:03:08.098
Host Physical Attributes Re-Indexed

80
00:03:08.248 --> 00:03:09.973
Base Constitution Allocated:

81
00:03:10.173 --> 00:03:11.323
Two Hundred Points.

82
00:03:12.196 --> 00:03:13.709
Ethan rose to his feet.

83
00:03:14.471 --> 00:03:16.546
The persistent ache that had plagued his chest

84
00:03:16.559 --> 00:03:18.171
for seven years had vanished.

85
00:03:18.934 --> 00:03:20.371
In its place was a dense,

86
00:03:20.496 --> 00:03:21.446
heavy stillness

87
00:03:21.621 --> 00:03:23.971
a weight distribution within his muscles that felt

88
00:03:23.984 --> 00:03:26.621
less like biological tissue and more like forged

89
00:03:26.634 --> 00:03:27.309
tungsten.

90
00:03:28.071 --> 00:03:30.334
The system displayed a strict requirement:

91
00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:31.284
Current Level:

92
00:03:31.471 --> 00:03:31.871
1.

93
00:03:32.084 --> 00:03:33.321
Vessel Saturation:

94
00:03:33.521 --> 00:03:36.134
Zero of Five Thousand Experience Points.

95
00:03:36.896 --> 00:03:39.584
To understand what two hundred points in Constitution

96
00:03:39.596 --> 00:03:40.409
truly meant,

97
00:03:40.621 --> 00:03:42.896
he needed a proving ground where civilian eyes

98
00:03:42.909 --> 00:03:43.871
could not follow.

99
00:03:44.634 --> 00:03:47.396
Sector Nine harboured an unregistered sewer fissure

100
00:03:47.646 --> 00:03:50.096
a low-tier sub-gate that the municipal authorities had

101
00:03:50.109 --> 00:03:52.121
deemed too unprofitable to purge.

102
00:03:52.884 --> 00:03:54.959
Dropping through the rusted maintenance hatch,

103
00:03:55.071 --> 00:03:57.559
Ethan landed in the subterranean catacombs.

104
00:03:58.321 --> 00:04:00.446
The air reeked of damp sulphur and old

105
00:04:00.459 --> 00:04:00.971
rot.

106
00:04:01.734 --> 00:04:02.921
In the shadows ahead,

107
00:04:03.059 --> 00:04:05.859
three pairs of venomous crimson eyes ignited within

108
00:04:05.871 --> 00:04:06.546
the gloom.

109
00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:09.283
A Level Two Shadowfang Hound

110
00:04:09.483 --> 00:04:12.745
a beast engineered for ambushing civilian scavengers.

111
00:04:13.508 --> 00:04:14.858
With a guttural snarl,

112
00:04:14.933 --> 00:04:17.083
the alpha lunged across twenty paces,

113
00:04:17.295 --> 00:04:20.433
its serrated fangs aimed directly for Ethan’s jugular.

114
00:04:21.195 --> 00:04:23.770
Ordinary instincts would have screamed to dodge.

115
00:04:24.533 --> 00:04:26.520
But Ethan stood completely still,

116
00:04:26.645 --> 00:04:28.945
his eyes tracking the creature's trajectory.

117
00:04:29.708 --> 00:04:32.095
He raised his bare left forearm to intercept

118
00:04:32.108 --> 00:04:32.833
the strike.

119
00:04:33.595 --> 00:04:34.308
CRACK.

120
00:04:35.058 --> 00:04:37.320
The sound that echoed through the stone corridor

121
00:04:37.333 --> 00:04:39.008
was not the tearing of flesh.

122
00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:40.745
It was the sharp,

123
00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:43.908
violent snap of bone breaking against solid steel.

124
00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.270
The beast’s upper jaw shattered on contact.

125
00:04:48.033 --> 00:04:49.983
Its fangs splintered into fragments,

126
00:04:50.083 --> 00:04:53.045
scattering across the wet flags like cracked porcelain.

127
00:04:53.808 --> 00:04:56.445
To a creature possessing a combined physical strength

128
00:04:56.458 --> 00:04:58.033
of barely fifteen points,

129
00:04:58.183 --> 00:05:01.395
clamping down on Ethan’s two-hundred Constitution was equivalent

130
00:05:01.408 --> 00:05:03.220
to biting an industrial anvil.

131
00:05:03.983 --> 00:05:06.195
Ethan felt nothing more than a dull kinetic

132
00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:07.858
vibration against his skin.

133
00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.020
Zero penetration.

134
00:05:10.783 --> 00:05:11.858
Zero blood.

135
00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:13.983
Stepping into the pocket,

136
00:05:14.158 --> 00:05:16.220
Ethan drove a casual right palm into the

137
00:05:16.233 --> 00:05:17.583
creature's chest plate.

138
00:05:18.345 --> 00:05:19.908
Direct Kinetic Impact:

139
00:05:20.095 --> 00:05:22.083
One Hundred Percent Force Transfer.

140
00:05:22.845 --> 00:05:25.070
The impact shockwave blew out the back of

141
00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:26.295
the beast’s ribcage,

142
00:05:26.458 --> 00:05:28.720
sending the carcass hurtling twenty metres down the

143
00:05:28.733 --> 00:05:30.933
tunnel before collapsing in a heap of dust

144
00:05:30.945 --> 00:05:31.558
and bone.

145
00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:33.695
Target Neutralised.

146
00:05:34.458 --> 00:05:35.783
Experience Acquired:

147
00:05:35.945 --> 00:05:37.908
250  EXP.

148
00:05:37.995 --> 00:05:38.720
Progress:

149
00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.195
250   5,000

150
00:05:42.076 --> 00:05:44.101
Within the remains of the alpha hound lay

151
00:05:44.114 --> 00:05:45.564
an unformed skill orb

152
00:05:45.789 --> 00:05:47.664
a rarity in low-tier sub-gates

153
00:05:48.426 --> 00:05:49.989
Skill Manual Detected:

154
00:05:50.151 --> 00:05:52.501
Kinetic Resonance Passive Tier 1).

155
00:05:53.264 --> 00:05:54.664
Absorb Neural Data?

156
00:05:55.426 --> 00:05:57.701
Ethan pressed his palm against the crystal.

157
00:05:58.464 --> 00:06:00.651
The orb dissolved into a sudden cascade of

158
00:06:00.664 --> 00:06:01.939
electrical telemetry,

159
00:06:02.164 --> 00:06:04.601
surging through his optic nerves and slamming into

160
00:06:04.614 --> 00:06:05.826
his motor cortex.

161
00:06:06.589 --> 00:06:08.076
This was not the painless,

162
00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:11.476
cartoonish mastery promised in low-grade guild manuals.

163
00:06:12.239 --> 00:06:14.601
Ethan gritted his teeth as his brain violently

164
00:06:14.614 --> 00:06:17.864
integrated ten thousand repetitions of rotational footwork,

165
00:06:18.039 --> 00:06:20.626
impact mitigation, and kinetic dispersion.

166
00:06:21.389 --> 00:06:23.851
A thin bead of sweat traced his jawline.

167
00:06:24.614 --> 00:06:27.651
His muscular fibres twitched in involuntary spasms

168
00:06:27.664 --> 00:06:30.076
as his nervous system recalibrated to the foreign

169
00:06:30.089 --> 00:06:30.914
motor memory.

170
00:06:31.676 --> 00:06:33.176
Thirty seconds of agony...

171
00:06:33.326 --> 00:06:35.126
followed by absolute clarity.

172
00:06:35.889 --> 00:06:38.001
Every punch he threw was no longer just

173
00:06:38.014 --> 00:06:38.889
raw mass.

174
00:06:39.651 --> 00:06:42.814
Kinetic Resonance transformed his natural bodily durability

175
00:06:42.826 --> 00:06:44.064
into an offensive weapon:

176
00:06:44.314 --> 00:06:46.251
whenever an opponent struck his flesh,

177
00:06:46.401 --> 00:06:48.739
the dissipated kinetic energy would be stored and

178
00:06:48.751 --> 00:06:51.114
discharged through his next counter-strike with double the

179
00:06:51.126 --> 00:06:51.764
force.

180
00:06:52.636 --> 00:06:54.624
By the fourth hour of his expedition,

181
00:06:54.749 --> 00:06:57.636
the subterranean passage opened into an ancient drainage

182
00:06:57.649 --> 00:06:58.261
cistern.

183
00:06:59.024 --> 00:07:01.561
Ethan’s kill counter stood at eighteen hounds,

184
00:07:01.711 --> 00:07:04.374
his experience pool reaching three thousand two hundred

185
00:07:04.386 --> 00:07:05.036
points.

186
00:07:05.799 --> 00:07:08.361
A sharp whistling sound split the silence.

187
00:07:09.124 --> 00:07:11.236
Ethan tilted his head two inches to the

188
00:07:11.249 --> 00:07:11.811
left.

189
00:07:12.574 --> 00:07:15.061
A hardened steel crossbow bolt hissed past his

190
00:07:15.074 --> 00:07:15.474
ear,

191
00:07:15.686 --> 00:07:18.361
embedding itself four inches into the granite masonry

192
00:07:18.374 --> 00:07:19.124
behind him.

193
00:07:19.886 --> 00:07:22.424
From the perimeter shadows stepped fifteen men

194
00:07:22.649 --> 00:07:23.849
the Iron Jackals,

195
00:07:24.036 --> 00:07:27.011
a notorious syndicate of black-market scavengers who preyed

196
00:07:27.024 --> 00:07:29.686
on unlicensed porters in the lower catacombs.

197
00:07:30.449 --> 00:07:32.924
Their leader, a scarred veteran named Grigor,

198
00:07:33.111 --> 00:07:35.286
wielded a pneumatically powered siege hammer,

199
00:07:35.474 --> 00:07:37.749
flanked by riflemen holding the high ground on

200
00:07:37.761 --> 00:07:39.761
the rusted iron catwalks above.

201
00:07:40.524 --> 00:07:42.511
Well, well," Grigor chuckled,

202
00:07:42.636 --> 00:07:44.974
tapping his hammer against the iron railing.

203
00:07:45.736 --> 00:07:48.749
Vanguard Guild’s little trash-heap decided to go hunting

204
00:07:48.761 --> 00:07:49.861
all by himself.

205
00:07:50.624 --> 00:07:51.824
Hand over the cores,

206
00:07:51.936 --> 00:07:53.824
boy, and we might leave you with enough

207
00:07:53.836 --> 00:07:55.636
fingers to crawl back to the gutter."

208
00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.363
They did not attack one by one.

209
00:07:59.125 --> 00:08:01.688
The Iron Jackals were ruthless professionals:

210
00:08:01.888 --> 00:08:03.375
on Grigor’s hand signal,

211
00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.950
the four riflemen on the catwalk opened fire

212
00:08:05.963 --> 00:08:07.063
simultaneously,

213
00:08:07.275 --> 00:08:09.575
while the melee squad advanced in a disciplined

214
00:08:09.588 --> 00:08:10.800
interlocking wedge.

215
00:08:11.563 --> 00:08:14.413
Ethan did not attempt a reckless open-field charge.

216
00:08:15.175 --> 00:08:17.925
Instead, he snapped backward on his heels,

217
00:08:18.075 --> 00:08:20.438
retreating six metres into the narrow mouth of

218
00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:21.650
the drainage conduit.

219
00:08:22.413 --> 00:08:24.263
In a three-metre wide corridor,

220
00:08:24.425 --> 00:08:26.013
fifteen men meant nothing.

221
00:08:26.775 --> 00:08:29.513
Their numerical advantage collapsed into a bottleneck where

222
00:08:29.525 --> 00:08:31.638
only two men could engage at a time,

223
00:08:31.825 --> 00:08:34.938
completely obstructing the riflemen's line of fire above.

224
00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.475
The first two syndicate enforcers lunged forward with

225
00:08:38.488 --> 00:08:40.075
electric stun batons.

226
00:08:40.838 --> 00:08:42.538
Ethan stepped into their guard.

227
00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:45.650
Catching both batons with his bare hands,

228
00:08:45.775 --> 00:08:48.938
the high-voltage electrical discharge sizzled uselessly against

229
00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:50.175
his high-density skin.

230
00:08:50.938 --> 00:08:52.150
Twisting his wrists,

231
00:08:52.288 --> 00:08:54.675
he drove the two enforcers together with sickening

232
00:08:54.688 --> 00:08:55.350
force.

233
00:08:56.113 --> 00:08:59.663
The concussive collision pulverised their reinforced chest rigs,

234
00:08:59.775 --> 00:09:01.513
dropping both men instantly.

235
00:09:02.275 --> 00:09:03.913
Grigor dropped from the catwalk,

236
00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:06.588
his pneumatic hammer shrieking as its pressure chambers

237
00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.400
fired at maximum velocity.

238
00:09:09.163 --> 00:09:12.025
The warhammer descended like a falling meteorite directly

239
00:09:12.038 --> 00:09:13.475
toward Ethan's cranium.

240
00:09:14.238 --> 00:09:15.425
Ethan didn't duck.

241
00:09:16.188 --> 00:09:18.063
He raised his open right palm.

242
00:09:18.825 --> 00:09:19.500
BOOM.

243
00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:23.088
The kinetic shockwave blew out the subterranean water

244
00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:23.650
pipes,

245
00:09:23.825 --> 00:09:26.013
showering the tunnel in high-pressure mist.

246
00:09:26.775 --> 00:09:28.900
But Ethan’s arm did not yield a single

247
00:09:28.913 --> 00:09:29.600
millimetre.

248
00:09:30.363 --> 00:09:32.750
The massive steel warhammer was halted dead in

249
00:09:32.763 --> 00:09:33.413
mid-flight

250
00:09:33.613 --> 00:09:35.675
trapped in the vice-like grip of Ethan’s bare

251
00:09:35.688 --> 00:09:36.375
fingers.

252
00:09:37.252 --> 00:09:39.577
Grigor’s eyes bulged with primal terror.

253
00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:42.852
The pneumatic gauge on his hammer hissed violently,

254
00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.802
but the metal face had begun to cave

255
00:09:44.815 --> 00:09:47.215
inward under the sheer compressive pressure of Ethan’s

256
00:09:47.227 --> 00:09:47.690
grip.

257
00:09:48.452 --> 00:09:48.902
Who...

258
00:09:49.152 --> 00:09:49.827
what are you?!"

259
00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.927
Grigor stammered, frantically trying to dislodge the weapon.

260
00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.277
We work for House Vance!

261
00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:58.977
Touch me, and the Captain will hunt your

262
00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.215
entire bloodline!"

263
00:10:00.977 --> 00:10:03.590
Ethan’s expression remained carved from ice.

264
00:10:04.352 --> 00:10:06.740
Arrogance backed by a noble family’s name was

265
00:10:06.752 --> 00:10:08.315
currency in the upper city.

266
00:10:09.077 --> 00:10:11.277
Down here, in the cold dark beneath the

267
00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:14.115
streets, names held zero kinetic mass.

268
00:10:14.877 --> 00:10:17.427
Ethan discharged the kinetic energy stored from the

269
00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:18.590
hammer's impact.

270
00:10:19.352 --> 00:10:21.227
Kinetic Resonance Discharged.

271
00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:24.752
A focused shockwave erupted from Ethan's palm,

272
00:10:24.915 --> 00:10:27.477
tearing through the hammer's casing and blasting Grigor

273
00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:29.065
